00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:44.540
ROBERT KUBIS: So the first one
is the Cloud Spanner showcase,

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.210
where we have two
substations in that showcase.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:51.740
So one of them is what we call
the Cloud Spanner Kaleidoscope,

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:55.390
which is a really cool
looking installation

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.790
with some mirrors, and a
display, and some buttons,

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:02.810
and handles, and wrenches, which
is the-- in British English,

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:06.020
it's actually-- spanner
is a wrench [INAUDIBLE]..

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.850
What we wanted to show
there is the aspect

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.380
of manageability
in Cloud Spanner,

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:12.470
that it's very easy to
get your own instance

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:14.000
and scaling it in and out.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.730
And we wanted to show you
that it's done in four clicks.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.680
And you basically
choose a name, you

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:21.170
choose what configuration
you want to have,

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.570
you want to choose how many
nodes you want to have,

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.070
and then you click OK and
you have your own instance.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.360
So very easy.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:31.940
So the substation two is where
I actually show how easily

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:34.490
and how quickly Cloud Spanner
is scaling in and out.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:37.430
So I have a demo where you
can produce some throughput,

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.890
some reads and writes
against Cloud Spanner.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:41.760
And then you can
scale it in and out,

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.100
or you can scale the nodes.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:46.490
And you see how quickly
Spanner is load balancing,

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:49.250
and your latencies go down
again, and things like that.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.667
It's a really cool thing.

00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:52.250
I encourage everybody
to check it out.

